// Building definitions for Helios Ascension
//
// This file defines all building types, their costs, prerequisites, and effects.
// Modding Guide:
// - Add new buildings by copying an existing entry and changing the fields.
// - `id` must match a BuildingType enum variant name (e.g. "Mine", "DeepDrill").
// - `resource_costs` lists resources consumed from the global stockpile on construction.
// - `maintenance_resources` lists resources consumed per year to keep the building running.
// - `required_tech` is the tech ID that must be researched to unlock the building (empty = always available).
// - `modifiers` apply global bonuses when the building is operational.
// - `build_points`, `workforce`, `category`, `icon`, `description` control display and simulation.

